**BuildLilyPad(name, cx, cy, radiusX, radiusY, z, tilt, sub, segments, rings)** — a disc with a notch (angular gap) and doming.

**BuildSunShaft(name, topX, topY, bottomX, bottomY, topWidth, bottomWidth, curve, zTop, zBottom, sub, segments)** — a long tapered ribbon from the top of the frame to lower area, with perspective z variation.

