**BuildSheet(name, x0,x1,y0,y1, z, bulge, uv Rect, cols, rows, tintAlpha)**:
for j in 0..rows, i in 0..cols: fx = lerp(x0,x1,i/cols), fy = lerp(y0,y1,j/rows). zz = z + bulge*( (|fx|/halfW)^2 + ((fy-cy)/halfH)^2 )? For the backdrop, edges should come *closer* (smaller z) to wrap around → zz = z - bulge*norm². 
UV: u = uv.x + uv.width * (i/cols), v = uv.y + uv.height * (j/rows) where uv.y is bottom (v=0 at bottom). I'll define sub-rects in "top-left" terms and convert.

Vertex position: LayerPoint(fx, fy, zz).

**BuildDuneBed**: x0,x1,y0,y1, zNear (at y0, bottom), zFar (at y1, top), amplitude, uvRect, cols, rows, tileU.
for j: t = j/rows; y = lerp(y0,y1,t); z = lerp(zNear,zFar,t);
for i: x = lerp(x0,x1,i/cols);
height offset in z: dz = amplitude * (sin(x*2.1 + t*3.0) * 0.5 + sin(x*4.7 - t*5.2)*0.3 + sin((x+t)*1.3)*0.2);
Also y ripple small: dy = 0.05*sin(x*3.3 + t*2.0).
z += dz; y += dy.
UV: u = uv.x + uv.width * (x - x0)/(x1-x0) * tileU ; v = uv.y + uv.height * t. 
Also need tiling for u beyond 1 → wrap (Repeat) so it's fine to go >1.
